&lt;td&gt;€1.15B&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Arsenal have 16 players worth €50M or more, the most of any club.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


3. 636 contracts end in June 2027
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That is €3.9 billion of players who can sign a pre-contract elsewhere from January 2027. The most valuable:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="table-wrapper-paragraph"&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Player&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Club&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Value&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Omar Marmoush&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Tottenham&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;€50M&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Nick Woltemade&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Juventus&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;€50M&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Lisandro Martínez&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Manchester United&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;€45M&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Yasin Ayari&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Brighton&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;€45M&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Franco Mastantuono&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Fiorentina&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;€45M&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you are building a transfer-window model, &lt;code&gt;contractUntil&lt;/code&gt; is the single most useful column in the dataset.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


4. Biggest risers this autumn (players now worth €20M+)
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Barcelona's Xavi Espart went from €5M to €25M (+400%) in the October update. Newcastle's Sean Steur and Ipswich's Emersonn both roughly tripled. At the other end, Takefusa Kubo (−33%), Frenkie de Jong and Oihan Sancet (−29%) took the biggest cuts.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Caveats
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market values are Transfermarkt's community estimates, not fees. They move a few times a season, in steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ages are on the snapshot date (2026-11-27), not season start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Squads are current squads; loanees count for the club they play for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Data and a ready-made scraper
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The full table (value, change, peak, contract, club, nationality, position, foot and height for all 2,623 players) is a free dataset on Kaggle: &lt;a href="https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/kenmutisya/transfermarkt-player-values-sample" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Football Player Market Values: Top 5 Leagues&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To pull it yourself for any player, club or league, with value and transfer history, I put the scraper on Apify as &lt;a href="https://apify.com/scrapemint/transfermarkt-player-values" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Transfermarkt Player Values&lt;/a&gt;. Give it &lt;code&gt;{"leagues": ["premier league"]}&lt;/code&gt;, a club like &lt;code&gt;"Arsenal"&lt;/code&gt;, or player names.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Which contract-year player would you sign in January?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ESPN's website is built on a public JSON API. It has no docs and needs no key, and it covers scores, betting lines, standings, injury reports, rosters and news for the NFL, NBA, MLB, NHL, college sports and world soccer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I used it to pull every roster in the four major US leagues (&lt;strong&gt;5,111 players&lt;/strong&gt;) and answer some bar-argument questions. First, the endpoints.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


The endpoints
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Everything hangs off &lt;code&gt;site.api.espn.com/apis/site/v2/sports/{sport}/{league}/&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight plaintext"&gt;&lt;code&gt;/football/nfl/scoreboard?dates=20261130     games, scores, and the DraftKings line
/football/nfl/injuries                     league-wide injury report
/football/nfl/teams                        team list with ids
/football/nfl/teams/12/roster              one roster
/football/nfl/news?limit=25                headlines
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Standings live on a slightly different path: &lt;code&gt;site.api.espn.com/apis/v2/sports/football/nfl/standings&lt;/code&gt;. Swap &lt;code&gt;football/nfl&lt;/code&gt; for &lt;code&gt;basketball/nba&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;baseball/mlb&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;hockey/nhl&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;football/college-football&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;soccer/eng.1&lt;/code&gt; (Premier League) and so on.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three gotchas:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Send a normal browser User-Agent.&lt;/strong&gt; A custom bot string gets a flat 403.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Date ranges are flaky.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;?dates=20261101-20261107&lt;/code&gt; returns a 400 on some leagues. Loop one day at a time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Rosters come in two shapes.&lt;/strong&gt; NFL and NHL group players by unit (&lt;code&gt;athletes: [{position: "offense", items: [...]}]&lt;/code&gt;); NBA and MLB return a flat list. Handle both:
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight javascript"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;teams&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;'https://site.api.espn.com/apis/site/v2/sports/football/nfl/teams'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;headers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'User-Agent'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Mozilla/5.0'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;sports&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;leagues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="mi"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;map&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;r&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;fetch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="sb"&gt;`https://site.api.espn.com/apis/site/v2/sports/football/nfl/teams/${t.id}/roster`&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="n"&gt;headers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'User-Agent'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;'Mozilla/5.0'&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;json&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;players&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;athletes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;flatMap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;Array&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;isArray&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;items&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="k"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kd"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;players&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nb"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nf"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;abbreviation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;displayName&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;abbreviation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;college&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;??&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;''&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="p"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;The scoreboard is the other useful one for bettors: before kickoff each game carries &lt;code&gt;competitions[0].odds[0]&lt;/code&gt; with the spread (&lt;code&gt;details&lt;/code&gt;), total (&lt;code&gt;overUnder&lt;/code&gt;) and both moneylines.&lt;/p&gt;

