&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📦 &lt;a href="https://github.com/nickjvandyke/eslint-plugin-react-you-might-not-need-an-effect/releases" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;ESLint Plugin React “You Might Not Need An Effect” 1.2 → 1.3 - Broader derived state detection, third-party effect wrappers, context values treated as props, TypeScript-only syntax support&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
