&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://sentry.io/resources/metrics-workshop/?utm_source=thisweekinreact&amp;amp;utm_medium=paid-community&amp;amp;utm_campaign=metrics-fy27q4-metricsworkshop&amp;amp;utm_content=newsletter-secondary-register" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Sentry Metrics Workshop: See the Why Behind App Changes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

